  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The mass defect in a particular reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>. The amount of energy liberated is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi>kW</mi><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo></math> _____. (speed of light <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Energy liberated is given by, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3600</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi>kW</mi><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3600</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3600</mn></mfrac><mo> </mo><mi>kW</mi><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi>kW</mi><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math></p>",
